# Online match on the local platform, the host's side (alice): Create online
# match, wait for bob, then both play by keys (the zone cursor, Enter selects,
# Enter again kicks / dives; alice curves every shot with E, bob never does,
# so alice wins) to the result the server script records. No arrows: on the
# results they would move the UI's focus.
# viewport 1280x720
until 900 =Online Match
frames 30
click =Online Match
until 300 =Create online match
frames 10
click =Create online match
until 600 waiting for an opponent
frames 10
save online-host-lobby
until 3600 Online Match
until 3600 =Kick!
frames 20
save online-host-shoot
repeat 60000 until Result recorded by the StarHermit server.
  key KeyE 1
  frames 3
  key Enter 1
  frames 6
  key Enter 1
  frames 40
end
expect =You win!
frames 30
save online-host-results
